            "title": "Printing",
            "id": 52864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan <code>console.log()</code> di sekitar <code>tasks.length</code> untuk menampilkan panjang array <code>tasks</code> di console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console.log</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan jumlah elemen dalam <code>tasks</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks[0]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"size\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console.log</code>, diikuti oleh <code>tasks</code>, dan terakhir <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>",
